sequenceDiagram
    participant U as You
    participant A as Agent
    participant B as LocalShellBackend
    participant OS as Your machine
    U->>A: "run: echo 'hello' > greeting.txt"
    A->>B: execute(command="echo 'hello' > greeting.txt")
    B->>OS: subprocess in root_dir, timeout=30, inherit_env=False
    OS-->>B: stdout / stderr / exit code
    B-->>A: tool result
    A-->>U: one-sentence confirmation
    OS-->>U: ./workspace/greeting.txt exists on disk
